sequenceDiagram
  participant W as Writer
  participant AI as AI
  participant R as Content Ops and Med Writer
  participant B as Brand
  participant M as MLR
  W->>AI: manuscript
  AI->>AI: assemble approved content, pull compliance blocks
  AI->>R: draft, inline
  R->>W: sign-off or edits, while the writer is still in it
  W->>AI: final edit
  AI->>AI: generate HTML, run the metadata checklist
  AI-->>W: checklist fails, back to the writer
  AI->>B: Send Preview to Brand appears only when it passes
  B->>M: to review
  Note over M: Not designed in this concept
